{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>Do not harden</b> — the commentators erred." "<b>Like the day of Massah</b> — and the correct view in my eyes: it was given at the incident of the spies and Merivah." "<b>And Massah</b> — for there it is written: וינסו אותי זה עשר פעמים ולא שמעו בקולי (and they tried Me these ten times and did not heed My voice)."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 95, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:37:21.158989287Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}